    {
      "space": "DJI D-Log M",
      "kind": "BLOCKED",
      "reason": "DJI has refused repeated requests to document this curve; it is explicitly a black box. It is NOT the same curve as D-Log ('slightly less flat', per CineD's review). No published constants exist, and deriving them means reverse-engineering DJI's own LUTs, which their terms do not permit. Community efforts exist (Zeb Gardner's colour-chart based fit) but are unofficial, method-dependent and not published as constants."
    },
    {
